41398::$$$message_0292_0000_0000$$$::"Big and little Gilgame.[br]Which one did you drop?"::
41399::$$$message_0292_0001_0000$$$::"Gold, silver, big, small, I'll pass on all of them."::
41400::$$$message_0292_0002_0000$$$::"Kid Gil is pretty popular, though."::
41401::$$$message_0292_0003_0000$$$::"According to the character artist, 'we revived his old personal outfit (right) which we cut from the main story of FSN for being too absurd and cringe-worthy. Kid Gil followed the same pattern,' supposedly."::
41402::$$$message_0292_0004_0000$$$::"No one asked for this... What pattern? The bare midriff?"::
41403::$$$message_0292_0005_0000$$$::"Of course. Pretty looks are all about showing your chest. [br]I hope a certain someone doesn't strip down any further."::
41404::$$$message_0292_0006_0000$$$::"I won't."::

